<title>BELARUS: Belarus rouble edges down to 22,900 per dlr in Min.</title>
<headline>Belarus rouble edges down to 22,900 per dlr in Min.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belarussian rouble edged down to 22,900 per dollar on the Minsk Interbank Currency Exchange from 22,800 at the previous session.</p>
<p>					    February 28	February 27</p>
<p> Belar rouble rate to dollar	   22,900	     22,800</p>
<p> Volume traded			  $2.871 million	 $2.411 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 226</p>
